{"mapId":100480840,"appId":"1","authorId":50174191,"title":"快乐小屋","cover":"https://assets.box3.fun/content/r8yYnZKjcSyt2M0JlPS57Wuvm8J0yR680UD4ZWsgk-w.png","description":"暑假的时候跟小朋友一起建的，好像在她身上看到了我刚入岛时候的影子，很怀念以前在旧岛只会建房子花园的日子，在这张地图里玩过很多，也聊过很多。捉迷藏躲到地底下的时候我绷不住了，想回到2021，背景音乐是我喜欢的流歌，入坑曲，每次听都会哭\n\n欢迎来到快乐小屋！在这座充满惊喜的温馨小屋里，治愈画风与轻快音乐交织，带来无尽休闲乐趣。适合所有年龄的玩家，一起探索隐藏的秘密，享受属于你的梦幻空间，体验轻松又有趣的冒险时光！","notice":"","version":1,"publishedAt":"2026-04-04T18:24:12.266","updateAt":"2026-04-04T18:24:12.266","playHash":"7e4605b9b40719e5fd56","onlineCount":0,"playCount":0,"favoritesCount":0,"commentCount":7,"viewCount":12,"likeCount":2,"mediaResourcesHash":["https://assets.box3.fun/content/W7X0jf6deqE02-WGSTrR7fcjbpZ-nkRagGT8UVZZFWA.png","https://assets.box3.fun/content/1wO4ll3TcIfW8qDaeOQo3fwn4i4PbRZQpt6uOV5pfIQ.png","https://assets.box3.fun/content/GxBnRMUEkyaElDpn1PWadC2h4O0WO8s_Upv1QpgtGDM.png"],"labels":[{"labelId":3,"labelName":"原创","labelKey":"original"}],"currentReleaseVersion":1,"combType":0,"weight":0,"teamable":false,"_tab":"mapCasual"}